Subject: [PATCH] feat: add route-history API for probe route detection

- POST /api/route-history: script pushes hourly route probe results
  (JWT auth, same as admin API)
- GET /api/route-history: theme reads history (public if site is
  public, >24h requires login, same as /api/history/all)
- D1 table route_history (server_id, timestamp) keeps 7 days
- History entries: routes_tag + per-carrier label and hops
